<%# What the listen region holds: a button that asks for the audio, a line
    while it is being made, or the player once there is something to play.

    The region itself is in editions/show, not here, and that is deliberate.
    The job writes into this partial's output with a Turbo update rather than
    replacing the element around it, so the live region stays put across all
    three states — which is what lets a screen reader announce the player
    arriving instead of the change happening silently.

    The subscription lives in the preparing branch alone. It is the only state
    an update can arrive in, and rendered unconditionally it would open a cable
    connection on every edition anybody reads, polling the cable database twice
    a second, for a page where nothing will ever be broadcast.

    The element is the browser's own <audio controls> and not a player of this
    app's making, which is a deliberate and temporary departure from
    docs/siftbox-redesign.md §2 — its chrome is a rounded, shaded pill and will
    be the only one on the site. What it buys is the whole point of the feature:
    a single source played by the browser's own media pipeline keeps playing when
    a phone locks, appears in Control Centre, and is reachable by keyboard and
    screen reader without any of that being built here. A player matching the
    design system can replace it once there is an opinion about how the editions
    sound, which is the question this first version exists to answer.

    preload="none" so an edition nobody plays costs no bytes, and so the range
    request that starts playback happens when the reader asks for it. %>
<% if recording.ready? %>
  <audio class="listen__player" controls preload="none"
    src="<%= recording.path %>" aria-label="<%= recording.label %>"></audio>
<% elsif recording.preparing? %>
  <%= turbo_stream_from recording.channel %>

  <p class="listen__preparing"><%= recording.preparing_line %></p>
<% else %>
  <%= button_to recording.invitation, recording.path, class: "listen__button" %>
<% end %>
